cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EvalWitness, cite this software and the exact verified release manifest."
type: software
title: "EvalWitness: a verifier audit lab for coding-agent trajectories"
authors:
  - family-names: Schulze
    given-names: Christopher
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
keywords:
  - coding agents
  - evaluation
  - evidence provenance
  - LLM verifier
  - reproducibility
  - trajectory audit
abstract: >-
  EvalWitness is a provider-portable, reproducible verifier audit lab for
  coding-agent trajectories. It combines a production-oriented Go service with
  strict score evidence, exact replay, content-addressed capsules, controlled
  falsification, and bounded empirical analysis. Evidence, verifier inputs,
  decisions, negative controls, and public claims remain independently
  checkable.
